        "created_at": "2017-06-01T17:16:01.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hello everyone,<br>\nI am planning out my Gen Con trip, and it wouldn’t be complete without the Greater Than Games Charity Auction. However, I am unable to find it in the event listing. Is it there and I am just blind? Is it not listed yet? Will it be a non-listed event? Is there (gasp!) not going to be an auction this year?<br>\nI need to know!<br>\nThanks!</p>",
